    %% Relay Health Scoring Algorithm
    note1["`**Health Score Calculation:**
    Score = (Uptime × 0.4) + (Latency × 0.3) + (Success Rate × 0.3)

    **Degradation Triggers:**
    • Latency > 2000ms
    • Success rate < 80%
    • 3+ consecutive errors

    **Failure Triggers:**
    • Timeout > 10s
    • Connection refused
    • 5+ retry failures
    • Invalid responses`"]

    %% Connection Pool Configuration
    note2["`**Pool Configuration:**
    • Min Connections: 3 (primary)
    • Max Connections: 10 (all tiers)
    • Connection Timeout: 10s
    • Idle Timeout: 5 minutes
    • Ping Interval: 30s
    • Max Events/sec: 100 per relay`"]

    %% Relay Selection Strategy
    note3["`**Selection Strategy:**
    1. Check primary relays first
    2. If all degraded, try secondary
    3. If all failed, use backup
    4. Geo-optimize for user location
    5. Load balance across healthy relays
    6. Maintain 2+ active connections`"]

    %% Error Handling
    note4["`**Error Handling:**
    • Network errors: Auto-reconnect
    • Rate limits: Backoff + retry
    • Invalid auth: Skip relay
    • Protocol errors: Log + report
    • Timeout: Mark degraded
    • Server errors: Failover`"]

